The execute_*_dispatch actions (origin/destination/schedule) require dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, and not dispatched ?candidate. Effects: dispatched ?candidate, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot.

