Dispatch_ready can be set via mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready or mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready or after finalize_candidate... finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation, finalize_candidate_direct, finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation set dispatch_ready ?candidate.

